WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.020
{OP}

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.190
HeartCatch

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.650
Precure!

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.180
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.190
Now, all together

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.660
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.290
Within each of our chests,

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.960
they begin to sprout

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.630
The seeds of the heart

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.930
are growing

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.550
bit by bit

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.220
Red,

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:33.850
white

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.140
and yellow

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.890
It's because these blooming buds are

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.310
all varied colors

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.770
that they

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.980
shine so brightly!

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:48.280
That smile that you've nurtured

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.780
with such care

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.490
will never wither

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.080
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.960
Now, all together

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.460
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.130
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:10.010
They're always right by our sides

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:10.840
So together

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:14.690
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.640
bloom even more!

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:19.140
HeartCatch

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:20.640
Precure!

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:30.270
P-Precure?!

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:32.560
It's a Precure!

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:35.340
Precure! Precure!

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.490
A super strong Precure!

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:40.200
Pretty, pretty, Precure!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.580
Cure Blossom!

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:42.870
Blossom!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.050
All right!

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.410
Precuuuuure!

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.840
Clap, clap, clap.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:54.340
In that case, we'll take them down, Precure and all!

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:55.920
Doll!

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:56.630
Huh?

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:03.060
What?!

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.850
Why the heck can I jump this hiiiigh?!

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.250
Allow us to explain!

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:08.910
Huh?

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.810
It's because you're a Precure!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:15.840
But I'm... afraid of heights!

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.320
Blossom!

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:32.730
Was it really a good idea to make her a Precure?

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:41.890
I'm the Weakest

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:41.890
I'm the Weakest

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:45.100
Doll! Doll!

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.480
Cure Blossom, watch out!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.210
Huh?!

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.440
You can't run away!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.190
But...

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.610
Hey, look where you're going!

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.570
I'm running so fast that I can't stop myself!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.070
Cure Blossom!

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:10.670
Huh?!

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.830
Doll!

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.330
My eyes are spinning...

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.720
Get a hold of yourself!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.720
This is the legendary warrior, Precure?

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:30.890
How pathetic can you get?

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.900
I'm just so powerful I can't control it... {Fixed misspelling of 'surpress'}

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:37.100
Now's your chance to finish them!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.280
Doll!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.970
Nooooooo!

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:41.860
Stop!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.650
You can't just keep running away!

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.740
You're a Precure! You have to fight!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:50.160
Let go of me! You'll pull my skirt off! {Changed 'off' to 'of.'}

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.030
What an idiot.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:58.020
You might be the weakest Precure in history!

00:03:58.830 --> 00:03:59.880
Just finish them already.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:06.290
Dammit, why won't you hold still?!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.690
Now crush her!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.070
Cure Blossom!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.280
What do we do? What do we do?

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:30.910
It's no use!

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:35.500
Hmm?

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.380
Wh-What on earth?!

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.680
Thank goodness you're fine, Blossom!

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:07.990
I don't know who you are, but thank you so much!

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.850
Oh wow, what a hottie...

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.290
Wait, I mean... Who the hell are you?!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.250
Doll!

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.850
They vanished?! What's going on here?!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.250
Dammit, even the fairies got away!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.640
Desertrian, find them, no matter what!

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:39.980
Tsubomi.

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:41.790
Tsubomi.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.740
Grandma?!

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:50.700
How did I end up... here?

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:54.910
When I came in here, you were just lying there.

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.920
Oh! Blossom!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.950
Oh, it's Cure Flower!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.140
Huh?!

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.820
Chypre! And Coffret, too! It's been a while.

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:09.510
What?!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:13.440
Wait, Grandma, you know these two?!

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.390
Indeed I do.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.560
So the "Cure Flower" these two mentioned...

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:19.840
Is actually me.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.270
I used to be a Precure!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.230
Wha—?!

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.690
You did?!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:30.660
I thought you've always been in charge of the botanical gardens here!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.660
I have been.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:37.280
And while I was doing research on the Great Heart Tree, I met Coupe.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.070
The legendary fairy!

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:41.170
It's Master Coupe!

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.920
Legendary fairy?

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:46.590
Master Coupe?

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:51.140
Coupe was my partner back when I was a Precure.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.600
He's Chypre and Coffret's predecessor.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.730
That's a fairy?

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.810
He doesn't look like one at all...

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.130
You're so cool!

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:04.050
I hope I become like you soon!

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:07.000
Huh?! What on earth about him is cool?!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.610
That's very rude, Tsubomi!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.410
Master Coupe is an idol to us fairies!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:15.010
The weakest Precure in history has no right to say such things.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:16.040
Exactly.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:16.740
Huh?

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.830
Wait, you mean... Tsubomi is a Precure?!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:20.850
That's right!

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:25.870
Tsubomi said she'd seen the Great Heart Tree in her dreams, so we gave her the Heart Perfume... {Ugh, three lines of subtitles.}

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:28.420
And she transformed into Cure Blossom!

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:33.630
Tsubomi, could the dream you had be of Cure Moonlight being defeated?

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:34.260
Yes.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.070
I saw it so many times.

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:41.300
And then I met these two, and they just made me into a Precure.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:44.510
We were being chased by Sasorina, one of the commanders of the Desert Apostles.

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:47.810
And then Sasorina and her Desertrian attacked us!

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:50.490
I see... That must've been tough for you.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:55.890
Still, I can hardly believe my ears about Tsubomi becoming a Precure...

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:02.540
However, Tsubomi, your love of flowers makes you perfectly suited to the role.

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:08.750
Hey, Grandma... what exactly is the Great Heart Tree?

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.890
The Great Heart Tree is...

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.930
the origin of the Flower of the Heart.

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.590
The Flower of the Heart?

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:16.890
Yes.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:22.470
Everyone has their very own Flower of the Heart within their heart.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:25.700
And each flower is its own variety and color.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.730
No two are the same.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:31.650
So I have one too?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.860
Of course you do!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:40.120
The Great Heart Tree is connected to the Flower of the Heart by an unseen force.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:44.900
And if the Flower of the Heart is 
saddened or changed for the worse,

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:47.790
the Great Heart Tree is weakened.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:55.130
That reminds me. These two said the flower of Erika's heart had turned red...

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:57.470
That's right! What happened to Erika?!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.360
Don't worry!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:06.650
Erika!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:10.480
The poor girl.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.900
Her Flower of the Heart was pulled out, wasn't it?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.270
It was Sasorina and her cronies!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.890
And it looks like they're nearby!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:20.740
Huh?

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:27.370
It's a Desertrian!

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.210
I found you, fairies!

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:33.170
Someone spoiled our fun earlier,

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:36.670
but you won't escape this time.

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:58.490
<i>Erika...</i>

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:05.700
I was only trying to help Tsubomi by making her more fashionable!

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.590
And still Momo had to make it her business!

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:11.290
Erika!

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:24.310
The white cyclamen Flower of her Heart will soon turn entirely red!

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:27.770
In the language of flowers, a white cyclamen means "purity"...

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.810
If it turns red, it will become "jealousy"!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.100
And then what'll happen?

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.190
The only thing left will be for it to wilt...

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:42.360
And once it wilts, her heart will be consumed, and she'll sleep within this sphere for all eternity!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.940
No way...

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:49.600
To save your friend, you'll have to become a 
Precure and defeat the Desertrian, Tsubomi!

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:52.270
Quickly, transform into a Precure!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:53.860
G-Got it!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:54.880
Huh?

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:57.410
It's gone. Gone. Gone!

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.220
What?

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:02.910
That thingy I have to spray to transform... is gone!

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:03.850
Whaaaaat?!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:07.470
Now, Desertrian! Beat them to a pulp!

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:31.960
Where did you leave the Heart Perfume?!

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:34.700
It's not that easy to remember...

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.050
It's the Heart Perfume!

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:44.260
It was lying next to you when you collapsed.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.650
Thank you, Grandma! {Capitalized 'grandma' due to proper noun}

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.940
Just hold on a little longer...

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.510
I'm definitely going to rescue you, Erika!

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.770
Go forth, Seed of the Precure!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.670
Precure! Open My Heart!

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:01.950
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:07.210
Cure Blossom!

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:27.280
This is the power of Precure?

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.960
What the hell are you doing?!

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.580
You've gotta do better than that!

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.620
Doll!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.830
Whaaaaat?!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.100
Blossom!

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:06.420
Not only do you make Erika suffer, but the flowers too.

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:08.050
I...

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:11.760
I've had it up to here with this!

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:31.930
Huh?

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.390
I sorta feel... stronger than before.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:40.350
Feelings of wanting to protect your friend and those flowers strengthen your abilities as a Precure.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:42.040
I see!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.590
This isn't the time to admire yourself!

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:45.280
You're right!

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:51.620
I'm afraid your luck has run out.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:57.660
Once my poison stinger gets you... you're finished.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.950
For someone like you, who tramples on people's hearts...

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:03.960
I won't budge a single inch!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:04.800
What?!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.690
Precure sure are strong, aren't they?

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:21.260
Cure Blossom, use this chance to defeat the Desertrian and take back the Flower of your friend's Heart!

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:22.900
D-Defeat it?!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.200
How am I supposed to do that?!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.590
Use the Blossom Tact!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:31.360
Shout out "Gather, Floral Power! Blossom Tact!"

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:33.070
Got it!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.710
Gather, Floral Power!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.000
Blossom Tact!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:53.680
And then shout "Flowers, shine forth! Precure Pink Forte Wave!"

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.400
Flowers, shine forth!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:12.000
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.050
Curse you, Precure!

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.720
Next time we meet, I'll strike you down with my poison stinger!

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:48.020
Blossom!

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:51.400
You must return the Flower of her Heart to her!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.030
Wh-What?!

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:03.160
Erika!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.930
Thank goodness...

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:16.830
Where am I?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.600
The greenhouse at my grandma's botanical gardens!

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:22.380
How did I end up here?

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:26.660
We found you collapsed outside the park, so we brought you here.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:28.350
So that's what happened...

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.980
Wh-What's wrong, Erika?

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:36.090
While I was asleep, I had this really realistic dream.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.770
Someone pulled a flower out of my heart,

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.490
then put it into a doll, which went berserk!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.180
Huh?!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:45.940
And this Cure Something-or-other appeared... {Added hyphens.}

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.620
Th-That's...

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.670
What an interesting dream.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.550
I know, right?

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:58.800
All right! Tsubomi!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:00.970
Well... um...

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:02.470
I'm sorry!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.270
Huh?

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:12.360
I only think about myself and keep imposing what I want on others, unlike Momo...

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.890
That's not true!

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:20.340
You thought so hard about how to help me change, after all.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.700
Then you're not mad at me?! {Changed 'with' to 'at.'}

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.550
Not at all!

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:25.370
And more importantly, Erika...

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:28.310
No need to be so formal. We're friends now!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.790
Gotcha, Erika!

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:36.800
If I join the Fashion Club, will we be able to make this doll even cuter?

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.800
You're gonna join the Fashion Club?!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.370
If you don't mind sharing me with the Gardening Club...

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:45.180
Thanks so much! Glad to have you!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:47.770
That's right, I was in the middle of going shopping!

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:51.270
I'll have this guy fixed up by tomorrow!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.300
Tsubomi, Tsubomi's grandma,

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:58.150
thanks for helping me when I collapsed!

00:18:58.150 --> 00:18:59.240
See ya!

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:05.370
I think a Heart Seed is going to be born!

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.170
What the heck is this?

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.830
It's a Heart Seed.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:18.340
It was created because Erika's 
Flower of the Heart was purified.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.360
Now it's my turn!

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.180
And this is?

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:27.600
The Heart Pot!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:31.790
If we gather a lot of Heart Seeds within the Heart Pot,

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:34.210
we'll be able to revive the Great Heart Tree!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.940
Now, place the seed in here!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.400
O-Okay...

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:43.830
Tsubomi,

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:49.650
as they attempt to eliminate the human heart, and with it the Great Heart Tree,

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:51.920
the Desert Apostles' attacks will only become fiercer.

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.400
It'll be all right!

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:59.380
My partner, Tsubomi, will become a Precure and protect us!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.630
You're my partner? {Changed 'You are' to 'You're'}

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.770
That's right!

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:06.960
I bring forth the Seed of the
 Precure and offer you advice!

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:09.770
I'm Chypre! Once again, it's 
good to be working with you!

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:11.290
Same for me.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.970
I'd be worried if it was just Tsubomi on her own.

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:17.690
You <i>are</i> the weakest Precure in history, after all.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.020
What's with that?!

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:21.150
I beat that Desertrian, didn't I?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:25.190
I need to find a partner who'll become a Precure too!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:27.120
I'm sure you'll find one!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.690
We'll look after Chypre and Coffret at our place.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:34.080
Won't this surprise Mom and Dad?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.530
It'll be fine!

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:38.250
We'll just pretend to be plushies! {Changed to 'plushies' to be consistent with episode 1.}

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:42.890
All right then, shall we head home?

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:47.720
Tsubomi.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:53.730
Being a Precure grants immense power, so you must be careful how you fight.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:54.730
I understand.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:21:01.070
For some reason, I feel like becoming a Precure has changed me a little.

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:04.160
That's a good thing, isn't it?

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:12.370
I didn't want to put you in danger, Tsubomi.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.070
Grandma?

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:20.840
But... protecting the Great Heart Tree is the mission entrusted to all Precure.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:26.550
Becoming a Precure means you'll have to stand up to the chaos that lies ahead.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:32.640
Just like the meaning of your name, you're still a bud waiting to bloom, Tsubomi.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:37.610
By becoming a Precure and working hard, you'll bloom into a fantastic flower.

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:38.900
Really?!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.530
I'm gonna do my best!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.200
Tsubomi?!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.200
That hurt...

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:51.000
How worrying...

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:53.250
What am I going to do with you, Tsubomi?

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:09.880
{ED}

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.770
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:21.690
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.610
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.570
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.120
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.080
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.250
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:44.710
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.680
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:53.680
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.520
is about to begin!

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:59.730
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.650
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.570
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:07.110
We're pretty

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.910
at full bloom!

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.030
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.080
until it shines

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.620
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:20.880
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.880
So don't sulk

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.800
because a smile's the best!

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:30.260
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.470
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.350
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:45.190
<i>Become a Precure with me!</i>

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:47.420
<i>I'm busy! I just don't have the time!</i>

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.740
<i>Then just try it with me! Just try it, okay?</i>

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:51.300
<i>One, two!</i>

00:23:51.300 --> 00:23:53.870
<i>Precure! Open My Heart!</i>

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:56.700
<i>See, you wanna do it now! Right?! Right?!</i>

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:59.500
<i>I said I wouldn't, so I'm not gonna!</i>

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:01.960
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:04.750
The Second Precure

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:04.750
The Second Precure

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:07.690
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
